      "review_description": "As a technical manager in a construction company, I am accustomed to running tendering processes for design and supply packages.  I am particular around the proposed work, specification, company profile and the works processes/arrangements. I will look in detail at prices, terms and conditions.Skytech were superb throughout.In blind submissions they provided the best price.Very accommodating and clear when asked to look at the price point some differing system set ups / specifications.Great communication ahead of the work.Outstanding levels of professionalism on the day of the install, with a genuine eye for detail, setting high standards in their workmanship, working in a safe and courteous manner around my home and family.Great follow up around how to make the best use-of and the monitoring of our system.They made the arrangement for the grid connection.It is a pleasure to engage a company who take pride in their work and their service.   I'm  happy to recommend Skytech and I have done so to friend already.",
